                    Commercial Policy”.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d897-f2" n="62" xml:id="d897-f2-content">
                <p>Filipino Rehabilitation Commission.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d897-f3" n="63" xml:id="d897-f3-content">
                <p>Approved March 24, 1934; 48 Stat. 456.</p>
            </note>
